  <ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock id="HHD790CCB2EDB33AB49E3957CEAFD4E7D7" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfSignificantEventThatRespondentParticipatesInACashManagementProgramsTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HH26F298D96F05ADD051F0C74B218AC0A3" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!-- [if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; A.&amp;#160; &amp;#160;Nature of Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"&gt;The respondent operates a high pressure natural gas transmission line in the Northern DJ Basin consisting of approximately 16 miles of 6" steel and 14 miles of 8" steel. The pipeline extends from Laramie County WY to northern Weld County CO, of which approximately 26 miles are located in WY and 4 miles in CO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!-- [if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; B.&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"&gt;The respondent is organized as a limited liability company and taxed as a partnership for federal income tax purposes. As a result, income or losses are taxable or deductible to the members rather than at the respondent level; accordingly, no provision has been made for federal income taxes in the accompanying financial statements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;"&gt;&lt;!-- [if !supportLists]--&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;#160; &amp;#160; &amp;#160; C.&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;!--[endif]--&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allocated expenses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"&gt;All expenses are allocated from parent entity, Roaring Fork Midstream, LLC.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
